  DIRECTORY TRAVERSAL        (Only used when $FZF_DEFAULT_COMMAND is not set)
    --walker=OPTS            [file][,dir][,follow][,hidden] (default: file,follow,hidden)
    --walker-root=DIR [...]  List of directories to walk (default: .)
